        "Product Name：",
        "Heavy‑duty Apron Feeder",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "Application Area：",
        "Applied in mineral processing, metallurgy, building materials, coal mining and other industrial sectors. Suitable for short‑distance conveying under bin pressure, with large material particle size and heavy‑duty start‑up condition.",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "Product Advantages",
        "1. Robust and durable with high reliability.\n2. During operation, emptying of the material bin and direct impact of large lumps onto the apron plate are prohibited. Blasting of large‑size materials on apron plates is strictly forbidden.",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
