      [
        "Performance Features",
        "1. Keyless connection is adopted for partial components. Expansion sleeves are used for connecting sprockets, supporting rollers and shafts; withdrawal sleeves and locking sleeves are applied for positioning between bearings and shafts. Shaft shoulders are not required, enabling arbitrary positioning. It features simple structure, reliable performance and flexible operation.\n2. Feed speed can be controlled by adjusting motor rotation speed via frequency conversion for convenient operation.\n3. Compact structure with small footprint.",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      [
        "Working Principle",
        "The motor drives the coupling and spiral bevel‑gear planetary reducer. The sprocket on drive shaft meshes with X216 track assembly to drive the 1250 single‑arc flat chain running at constant speed for material conveying. Feed rate is adjusted by variable‑frequency speed regulation.",
